# A6a R3: `lda S` with A already S on every way in goes when its N and Z
# are set again before anything reads them (peephole_xflow), and the
# reload of `sta S / tyx / lda S` goes across the transfer and a block
# label (peephole). The twin a_across_blocks_off pins the loads.
# the shape pinned here is the text rules' and the slots' own: the X/Y colour
# (lot XY, 2026-11-14) would hold this case's counter or index in a register
# itself (its shapes: xy_colour.checks)
env QBE_NO_XY_COLOUR=1
in fill: present @for_body\.\d+:\n\tsta\.l fbuf,x\n
in fill: present @for_join\.\d+:\n\tclc\n\tadc\.w #257
in column: present lda\.w tab,x\n\ttyx\n\tsta\.w out,x
in column: absent sta\.b tcc__lf\+\d+\n\ttyx
